ding, lot performance, and profitability that answer the requested pen, lot, ration, plan-variance, inventory, and cost-of-gain questions and export the filtered results as CSV.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-16\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-9\",\n    \"ASM-17\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 0.3333333333333333\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"The service response contains only records for the user's authorized yards and profitability fields allowed by the user's returned permissions\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-17.1\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The screen shows only the returned authorized-yard records and permitted profitability fields\",\n     \"when\": \"The user opens a dashboard or report\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A user exports a filtered dashboard or report view\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-17.2\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The downloaded file contains only the authorized-yard records and profitability fields shown to that user\",\n     \"when\": \"The export is generated\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A dashboard or report displays records or profitability fields and an updated permissions response removes access to some of that data\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-17.3\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The screen no longer displays the records or fields no longer permitted, and a subsequent downloaded file contains only currently permitted records and fields\",\n     \"when\": \"The web app processes the updated permissions\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"The feedlot web app shall display dashboards, reports, and exports using only records and profitability fields returned for the signed-in user's authorized yards and permissions, and remove previously displayed data from view and subsequent exports when returned permissions change.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-17\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-9\",\n    \"I-10\",\n    \"Q-1\",\n    \"ASM-14\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1